      "sender": "jupyter-ai-personas::jupyter_ai_acp_client::OpenCodeAcpPersona",
      "type": "msg",
      "body": "The `.opencode/` files are **already staged** for commit \u2014 they appear under \"Changes to be committed\" in `git status`. There's no `.gitignore` that would block them. You can commit right now with:\n\n```\ngit commit -m \"Add agent and command configs\"\n```\n\nWas there a specific error message you saw?",
